WEBVTT

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be.

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl!

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart!

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it.

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really!

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be.

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring.

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything!

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be.

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:51.810
I can't believe it's so late already!

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:53.890
I have to hurry! I'm gonna be late!

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:57.300
Go! Go! Hurry, hurry, Amu-chan!

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.620
You know, if you have so much free time, you could give me a hand!

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:02.500
Amu-chan, you've got seaweed in your teeth.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.560
She still has bedhead, too.

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:09.030
There, perfect.

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:10.980
What a huge fuss.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:12.550
Just to get ready in the morning.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:15.590
Shut up. Let's get a move on, you three!

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:16.910
Where's Su?

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:17.830
Huh?

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:20.980
Rattle, rattle.

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:23.310
I'm sorry to keep you waiting!

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:26.060
My morning walk is complete.

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:27.570
You were...

00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:29.120
We were here fretting...

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.930
And you were walking?

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:33.430
Yes?

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:38.450
Character Transformation! Amulet Clover!

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:38.450
Episode 10

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:40.850
I'm leaving!

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:43.810
Wait. Sis, you decorate.

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:45.340
Decorate?

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:48.480
Oh, the Christmas tree.

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:51.830
It's an early Christmas present for my two angels!

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:52.770
Twee!

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:55.460
They've been going on like this nonstop.

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:57.600
They want to decorate the tree with you.

00:02:57.930 --> 00:02:59.760
Decorate, huh?

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.290
Looks fun!

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:03.520
You should let me handle these things.

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:07.690
I won't let you outdo me in putting up cute decorations!

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:09.060
Okay then, it's a contest!

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:10.930
I gladly accept!

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:13.930
Super Characters!

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.370
Super Characters!

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:17.220
Super?

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:18.600
What?

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:19.890
It's nothing. Nothing at all.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:24.420
My goodness, that Ami of ours sure is full of imagination.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:26.680
Amu-ch-

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.640
So that's what's up.

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:37.290
When I get home, I have to help decorate.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.150
What's wrong with that?

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:41.020
You really have no idea.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:43.700
Super Character ormaments!

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.820
Stop it, Ami!

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.850
Pink! Pink!

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.710
That sounds troublesome.

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:52.260
Uh, yeah. That's too bad.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:54.260
But it's nice you're having so much fun.

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:56.220
Amu-chi, it's done!

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:57.870
Ta-da!

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.680
What do you think about something like this?

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:02.370
Great job as always, Miki. It's cute.

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:05.520
Why don't we decorate as soon as we get home?

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:06.640
Yeah.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:18.810
Okay, that's all for today's training.

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:20.750
Nice work, everyone-nya.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.100
It's them!

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:30.090
Oh, I think Ami would like this.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:33.780
What a wonderful big sister. You know exactly what she'd like.

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:35.810
No, it was just an idea.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.060
If you like it, I'll buy it for you.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:44.060
I won't accept charity from a subject!

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:46.070
I've decided. I want this.

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:47.610
I want this and this.

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:49.600
Su wants all this.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:53.440
Hey, you guys, I said you only get one thing each.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:54.430
Okay.

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:57.300
Man, they're having a good time.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:59.080
I've got a great idea!

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:01.310
Guys, listen up-nya.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:05.040
Psst, psst, psst, and then psst, psst.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.100
The target will be...

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:09.970
Thank you!

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:18.310
Her-nya!

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:21.990
Owie, that hurt.

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:27.100
Don't do that! Oh please, don't!

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:29.870
W-Wait!

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.930
Wait!

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:42.850
Okay, give it back to her here.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.930
I don't know anything about this-nya!

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.630
All right, see you at school tomorrow.

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:05.250
Thanks for coming with me.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.680
Send Ami-chan our regards.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:08.400
Later.

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:09.670
Bye-bye.

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.150
Let's go.

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:13.950
A-Amu-chan.

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:15.380
Hm? What's up?

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:17.090
Su is...

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:18.180
Don't tell me.

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:19.520
Yeah.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.770
Jeez. I only let her out of my sight for a second.

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:25.160
Where did she go?!

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:39.390
I was finally able to get out of there!

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:44.810
But where am I?

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:49.520
Su!

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:51.060
Su!

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:53.020
Su!

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:11.270
I'll get in trouble if I don't head back soon.

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:14.550
Why don't we go home for now?

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:17.740
Maybe she found her way back, like in "Homeward Bound."

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:19.060
Yeah, maybe.

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:26.330
I'm so hungry I can hardly move anymore.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:30.770
I cannot stop! The Christmas tree is waiting for me to decorate it!

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:34.020
I must make it back to Amu-chan's, no matter what.

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:36.950
But which way should I go?

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:40.270
Of course! When this sort of thing happens, I should...

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:49.660
Perhaps I'll try this way first.

00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:59.180
What's wrong, Yoru?

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:01.740
It's nothing! Nothing at all!

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:03.990
What are you doing-nya?!

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:06.970
I know you're hiding something.

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:10.710
I'm not hiding anything-nya.

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.390
It's pretty obvious that you are.

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:18.470
Okay! I was messing with one of Hinamori Amu's Guardian Characters and she ended up somewhere-nya!

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.310
So that's it.

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:28.520
Hey, I was just messing around.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.390
Why'd you do that-nya?!

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:34.580
Ikuto? Where are you going-nya?

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:42.020
Su still hasn't come home yet.

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:45.370
The tree's already been decorated, too.

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:49.430
And she was so looking forward to helping.

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:51.560
Yeah.

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:58.350
What are you doing here?!

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:01.970
I can't hear you.

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:07.770
I heard your Guardian Character went off towards the neighboring town.

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:10.680
I just wanted to tell you that, is all.

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:11.970
Wait!

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:16.510
Hold on. How do you know that?

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:17.770
Catch you later.

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:19.370
Hang on!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.860
The next town over?

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:22.720
That's pretty random of her.

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:26.220
You didn't say anything about me?

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:29.430
At the end of the day, we are enemies.

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:37.290
Ami-chan, that's beautiful!

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:40.770
I wish I had bought the tree earlier!

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:43.260
You're sure being pretty sneaky about this.

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:46.390
I'll get in trouble if they catch me going out this late.

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.850
Don't sneak around!

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.890
You're down in the dumps because you're tiptoeing around. Life is meant to be lived boldly!

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:54.290
Anyway, up next we'll be discussing tomorrow's lucky color.

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:58.500
And just where were you off to at this hour?

00:09:58.500 --> 00:09:59.770
U-Um...

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:03.700
Don't tell me it's "girl meets boy?!" Do you have a boyfriend?!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:04.950
No way!

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.640
Anyway, it's too late.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:08.140
But...

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:15.940
It's becoming rather cold.

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:20.270
What a majestic home.

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:23.140
Pardon me for intruding.

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:29.350
It's not here! It's not here! It's not here! The lip gloss I just bought is gone!

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:32.330
My lucky color was supposed to be pink!

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:35.340
I was going to wear it and capture Kukai-sama's heart!

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:37.930
I had it all planned out!

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:40.770
I'll find another place.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:53.930
I-I-I'm so very sorry!

00:10:55.130 --> 00:11:00.830
Oh, I see. You're lost, too.

00:11:01.230 --> 00:11:06.750
I know! Let's search for our homes together tomorrow.

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:10.100
When people are in trouble, they should help each other out.

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:15.810
I wonder where Su went.

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:18.030
It'll be okay.

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:21.310
Let's get some sleep. I'm sure she'll come back tomorrow.

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:23.400
You have a heart of ice.

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:35.440
So fluffy-wuffy, warm and comfy.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:57.740
Behold the shimmering lip gloss I stayed up all night to find.

00:11:58.350 --> 00:12:01.750
With this, I will surely capture Kukai-sama's heart, without fail.

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:06.910
From this day forth, I, Yamabuki Saya, will live out my school life as a celebrity of love!

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:10.890
Saya-sama, speak of the devil!

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:14.490
Kukai-sama!

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:17.270
Saya-sama, fight!

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:20.390
K-K-Kukai-sama!

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:22.140
S-Sorry.

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:24.100
Hey, what the heck are you doing?!

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:25.230
You should watch where you're go-

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:28.600
Saya-sama, your lucky lip gloss!

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.530
Hold it right there!

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:32.350
Saya-sama!

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:38.700
Good morning, Hinamori-senpai.

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.640
Yeah, good morning.

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:49.180
What?! Su ran away from home?

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:52.530
No, she didn't exactly run away.

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.180
At least, I don't think she did.

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:57.970
Do you have any places in mind where she might go?

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:02.180
I checked out a few places between my house and school, but...

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:07.510
It'll be fine. She's a bit laid-back, but she can take care of things when it comes down to it.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:11.930
You're right. After all, Hinamori did give birth to her.

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:13.930
Is that supposed to be encouraging?

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:16.470
Sorry about that.

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:20.640
Well, don't sweat it. We'll help you search after school.

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:21.940
Of course!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:22.520
Yeah.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:24.640
You guys...

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:27.360
I am slightly worried.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:28.260
Kiseki.

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:29.850
Got it.

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:36.330
Listen up, commoners, our strategy session regarding my plan for world domination is hereby postponed.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.690
We will now dispatch to search for Su.

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:39.930
Okay!

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:42.350
That sounds a lot better than a strategy session.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:43.490
Yeah.

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:44.820
I can hear you guys.

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:46.930
Bye, Amu-chan!

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:49.180
Good luck!

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:55.480
Thanks for yesterday.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:59.090
Thanks to you, Mr. Doggy, I had a wonderful sleep.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:07.510
Someone must have dropped it.

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:10.850
I-It's heavy.

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:15.380
Why, thank you.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:18.930
Let's drop it off at a local police station.

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:28.060
Hey, Su!

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:30.930
She's not here-dechu.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:33.520
What a bothersome commoner.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.520
Su!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:36.970
Su!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:42.810
Did someone drop this?

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.430
Now it'll be safe.

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:57.270
It's an X Egg!

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:01.720
This is bad! Mr. Doggy, chase after it!

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:06.600
What should we do?

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.260
This is...

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.600
It's what Su had Amu-chan buy!

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:21.160
You're...

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:25.060
You haven't gone back to her place yet?

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:28.600
Her? Do you mean Amu-chan?

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:30.220
Never mind-nya.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:34.140
Anyway, Ikuto, we'll have trouble if we don't take care of it-nya!

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:35.600
Yeah, you're right.

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:37.860
What are you going to do?

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:40.850
We're gonna destroy the X Egg, of course.

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:44.520
Clean-up's what we do, you know-nya.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:45.990
You mustn't!

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:51.620
Give it back-nya!

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:53.390
That's not fair!

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:55.810
I will not give you Mr. X Egg!

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.390
Stop interfering.

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:01.930
What are you doing, Ikuto?

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:07.890
There's no reason to Character Change to fight an opponent like that.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:13.020
She's pretty.

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:18.060
I'm going now, okay?

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:20.950
Be careful, Hinamori-san.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.460
We should go, too.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.060
Yeah.

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:29.740
There's no reason for an X Egg to exist.

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:31.870
Let's destroy it quickly so we can get out of here.

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:35.770
You mustn't destroy it.

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:40.640
Do you know of a way to deal with an X Egg, other than destroying it?

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:43.640
If Amu-chan were here, I'm sure she could do something.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.540
You're Hinamori Amu's Guardian Character?

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:49.370
Well then, that's even better.

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:01.240
The only thing we need is the Embryo.

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:04.980
These worthless X Eggs can just go ahead and disappear.

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:06.680
Isn't that right, Ikuto?

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:11.190
No! Amu-chan would never say such things!

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:16.080
Amu-chan would save the egg, no matter what it was!

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:17.770
That voice just now...

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:19.130
Did you hear that?

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:20.100
Yeah.

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:23.600
Su!

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:24.740
Amu-chan!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:26.680
Ikuto.

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:30.540
Who is that pretty girl?

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:32.620
An X Egg?

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:33.860
Amu-chan.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:34.560
Su.

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:36.540
What the heck is going on here?

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:38.130
I'll explain later.

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:41.140
We must save the egg, quickly!

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:45.950
Su, let's Character Transform.

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:48.300
You can do it, right?

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:50.650
Of course!

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:02.390
That's the Humpty Lock.

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:05.850
My heart: Unlock!

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:48.060
Character Transformation: Amulet Clover!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:51.820
Su, let's go.

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:52.970
Okay!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.480
Sugar, honey, syrup.

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:01.970
Let's make all your feelings of anger and depression sweet!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:08.540
Amu-chan!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:09.430
Yeah!

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:15.430
Remake Honey!

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:28.740
We did it!

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:32.290
They're not there.

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:39.680
I wonder who that girl was. She was really pretty.

00:19:42.710 --> 00:19:46.890
I won't lose. I refuse to let her win.

00:19:50.300 --> 00:19:54.470
I'll be the one to find the Embryo for Ikuto.

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:04.330
That was the first time you and I Character Transformed.

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:06.800
It's kind of embarrassing.

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:09.880
By the way, where have you been this whole time?

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:11.850
It doesn't matter.

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:14.290
Ran! Miki!

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:16.260
You dropped this.

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:17.890
Oh yeah.

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:20.310
She forgot.

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:22.770
Hinamori-san!

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:26.350
I'm so glad you found her.

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:28.930
Yeah. Sorry for making you guys look.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:33.390
Amu-chan, Character Transform with me one more time!

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:39.640
Leave fixing things to me!

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:43.640
Remake Honey!

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:55.520
South City 3rd Avenue should be around here.

00:21:00.850 --> 00:21:03.690
That must be his home.

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:05.650
That's wonderful.

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:08.710
All right, we should go home, too.

00:21:08.710 --> 00:21:09.850
Yes!

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:15.210
Bye-bye!

00:21:20.230 --> 00:21:22.340
It's sparkling.

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:24.390
Here, Su.

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:32.970
There we go.

00:21:33.280 --> 00:21:34.730
A lot happened today.

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:36.680
But it's finally done.

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:38.970
Way to go Su!

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:42.520
I found you, Super Characters!

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:45.000
Wait!

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:45.840
Amu-chan!

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:49.280
It ended up like this anyway!

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:51.600
How typical.

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:00.220
I'm ba-

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:08.370
Cool! Where were you? I was so worried!

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:12.600
Thanks to you, I missed my chance to talk to Hinamori-senpai.

00:22:13.050 --> 00:22:15.190
Cool!

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:41.290
As long as I exist, even when I'm a pile of dust,

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:47.690
I'll keep cheering "you can do it, you can do it" out loud!

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:48.510
(You can do it!)

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:54.670
I'll never stop as long as I live,

00:22:54.670 --> 00:23:01.020
so I'll sing my never-ending song.

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:05.530
I'll press forward down my path.

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.050
Even random characters have their merits.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:13.890
You might be worthless, but I'll still love you,

00:23:13.890 --> 00:23:15.360
my darling.

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:19.150
You idiot! My true self...

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:22.110
Just say what's on your mind.

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:25.540
You're sticking out a little.

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:28.810
You're coming closer to my dream.

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:32.590
You jerk! My true self...

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.840
Please come out, don't hide.

00:23:36.840 --> 00:23:41.780
Oh yeah! Right now!

00:23:50.600 --> 00:23:53.290
Next time, we'll be visiting a snowy mountain resort!

00:23:53.290 --> 00:23:55.930
There will be snowboarding, and even a hot spring!

00:23:55.930 --> 00:23:57.430
I can't wait!

00:23:57.430 --> 00:24:00.180
Holidays aren't all fun and games, you know.

00:24:00.180 --> 00:24:01.630
Three hundred hopping squats!

00:24:01.630 --> 00:24:02.270
Why?

00:24:02.270 --> 00:24:05.830
Run around the mountain for ten kilometers with a tire strapped to you!

00:24:05.830 --> 00:24:06.680
Even though it's a snowy mountain resort?!

00:24:06.680 --> 00:24:09.370
Finally, you will undergo a trial of courage.

00:24:09.370 --> 00:24:10.920
Even though it's winter?!

00:24:10.920 --> 00:24:12.090
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:13.610
The Snow Mountain Holiday!

00:24:13.610 --> 00:24:16.180
So why are we going there, anyway?

00:24:16.180 --> 00:24:17.110
Who knows.

00:24:17.110 --> 00:24:19.260
You don't know either?!
